Verse 1:
[Am]There's [Dm]a [Bb]Spirit [C]in [F]the [Am/C]air, telling [Dm]Christians [C]everywhere
[C]'Praise the [Gm]love [F]that Christ revealed, living, [Am]working in [C]our [F/C]world.'

Verse 2:
[Am]Lose [Bb]your [Dm]shyness, [C]find [F]your [Am/C]tongue; tell the [Dm]world [Gm]what [Dm]God has done:
[C]God in [Gm]Christ [F]has come to stay, we [Bb]can [Am]see His pow'r [C]today.

Verse 3:
[Am]When [Bb]believers [C]break [F]the [Am/C]bread, when a [Dm]hungry child is fed:
[C]Praise the [Gm]love [F]that Christ revealed, living, [Am]working in [C]our [F/C]world.

Verse 4:
[Am]Still [Bb]His [Dm]Spirit [C]leads [F]the [C]fight, [Am]seeing [Dm]wrong [Gm]and [C]setting [Dm]right:
[C]God in [Gm]Christ [F]has come to stay, we [Bb]can [Am]see His pow'r [C]today.

Verse 5:
[Am]When [Bb]a [Dm]stranger's [F/A]not alone, [C]where [Am]the homeless [Dm]find a home,
[C]Praise the [Gm]love [F]that Christ revealed, living, [Am]working in [C]our [F/C]world.

Verse 6:
[Am]May [Bb]His [Dm]Spirit [C]fill [F]our [Am/C]praise, guide our [Dm]thoughts [Gm]and [Dm]change our ways.
[C]God in [Gm]Christ [F]has come to stay, we can [Bb]see [Am]His power [C]today.

Verse 7:
[Am]There's [Dm]a [Bb]Spirit [C]in [F]the [Am/C]air, calling [Dm]people [C]everywhere;
